# Local credential scratch. `details.md` held a live till token, an owner login and
# the platform super-admin password — a `git add -A` away from being published to a
# branch and living in history forever. Ignored so that cannot happen by accident;
# real secrets belong in a password manager, not the working tree.
details.md
PLATFORM-ADMIN-PASSWORD.txt

# Staged third-party runtime for the desktop build (M5-01). ~135 MB of a trimmed JRE and
# Postgres' Windows binaries, rebuilt by `pnpm stage:runtime` — somebody else's build output,
# which does not belong in this project's history.
runtime/

# Machine-local Claude Code permission grants. `settings.json` beside it holds the
# shared skill overrides and is versioned; this one is whatever this machine has
# been asked to allow, and is nobody else's business.
.claude/settings.local.json
